sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant S as Shop
    participant P as Payment gateway
    participant Bk as Bank
    C->>S: Checkout cart
    activate S
    S->>P: Create payment intent
    activate P
    Note right of P: Amount and currency<br>are validated here
    P->>Bk: Authorise card
    activate Bk
    Bk-->>P: Approved
    deactivate Bk
    P-->>S: Intent confirmed
    deactivate P
    Note over S,P: Webhook arrives later
    P-)S: payment.succeeded event
    S-->>C: Order confirmation
    deactivate S
    Note left of C: Receipt by email
